.TITLE "systeminfo"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Displays detailed configuration information about a computer and its operating system. It includes hardware properties, OS version, and __network configuration__.

.DIV "ALIAS"

.DIV "TLDR"
**systeminfo**
Displays a comprehensive report of system information.
> 

**systeminfo /s computer**
Displays system information for a remote computer.
> __/s__ remote system flag

**systeminfo /fo list**
Displays the output in a list format for easier reading.
> __/fo list__ format flag

.DIV "SUMMARY"
Using __systeminfo__ is an easy way to check the original install date of Windows and the current uptime of the machine. It is a valuable tool for system administrators performing audits.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**windows:tasklist** **windows:ipconfig**

documentation: __https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/systeminfo__
